flowchart TD
  A[Checkout retry] --> B[Same idempotencyKey → same Order]
  C[Duplicate webhook] --> D[PaymentWebhookEvent unique + finalize idempotent]
  E[Stale unpaid] --> F[cron expire-orders / expireStaleUnpaidOrders]
  F --> G[Release reservations]
  H[notifyOrderPaid / Shipped] --> I[EmailOutbox]
  I --> J{Resend configured?}
  J -- No --> K[Local SENT log]
  J -- Yes --> L[Provider send]
  L -- Fail --> M[FAILED outbox — retry mail only not order]
  N[Amount mismatch bank] --> O[investigationStatus OPEN]
  O --> P[Admin resolves — no auto PAID]
